        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Otherwise only the small offenders who are caught at the spot can be prosecuted and y.s.patil 3 of 5 1-ABA-588-2024.odt the Shaikh Mohammad Ismael And Anr vs State Of Maharashtra on 4 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f37dc1eee4e94d12a78291f8e2b6fc92_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "and main offenders remained at large."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "543ad4df231f4ce7b9533843205a3492_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "I have perused the charge-sheet."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8317a66e5ce344d2909a31a15ec13e93_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The statements of the raiding party members and the panchnama support the narration in the FIR."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bd1b9ce4f7d944bb8b1a256fc182a4c1_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "At this stage,\nstatement of the arrested co-accused of the Applicants i.e. Ibrahim is important."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a601d67448054320adab776fd802585e_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is recorded on 09/04/2023."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0e7f4d2a4b7b46e494dd4348308db370_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He has stated that he was working as a driver on that truck."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "99cc3ff5ac414c23b72299b5b2c198a7_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Applicant Faruq was the truck owner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2e614978ba25462f9afa2f77fed46cec_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "On 06/04/2023, the Applicant Faruq told him that the truck was loaded with gutkha and that he should take that truck to Pune."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b480215e6edd472b93238163cf20bbd5_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Once he reached there, he should contact the other Applicant Ismael, who would send his persons and that accused Ibrahim should hand over the truck to them."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "19e910f0c57a4578a08c579b3efd2470_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "After unloading the goods he would return the truck."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d81bdb40b2cc45489f5cb3f597a3d4b4_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "7. Learned APP also relied on the CDR which shows that there was communication between the accused Ibrahim and the Applicant Ismael on 07/04/2023."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fe3846d8492a427e8cb62a898f0243fd_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The conversation was for 162 seconds."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ea54a33fbe014c04b3bbef086e15ec74_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThis supports the statement of the co-accused."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f659153960cb475e817865c75097ae91_48",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thus, at this stage, there is sufficient and definite materials against the y.s.patil 4 of 5 1-ABA-588-2024.odt present Applicants."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "71353b6df4e14469a53a117f4ff5ca8c_49",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "These materials can be taken into consideration."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0e689b447a234bcd99308af3570b76f9_50",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Otherwise, the investigating agency can not investigate the offence and cannot interrogate the main accused."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f2371b420b8549ff9abc3dade8bf8a2e_51",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The role of the Applicants is clearly mentioned by the co-accused They cannot claim ignorance or innocence in respect of this offence."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fa58a133c6e44db2a30b7979564a05a2_52",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Their custodial interrogation is necessary."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c0e02e11ad9045fd9ca367a50d796f37_53",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "They are the main accused and offenders in this offence."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "277562d09e29432a8f479893ffbb4978_54",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The arrested co- accused have played comparatively a minor role."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2dc70433081541c9a73d93f9b64bad18_55",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is necessary to interrogate the present Applicant to check the chain of supply and sale."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9b8eda6f60cb49b4ac21dff08edf30fb_56",
        "summary_section": "decision",
